request.description:
Returns dashboard tab counts for the calling user — no query params, no pagination.

Response: { success: true, data: { assigned: number, delegated: number, needsAttention: number, open: number, overdue: number, doneA: number, dueThisWeek: number } }

Uses the same filter logic as GET /tasks?view=... so counts stay consistent with the list endpoint.

